#ASSERT `What can I do about the goods` `a phone from a neighbour with a hidden fault` EQUALS `the implied conditions give me no remedy`
#ASSERT `What can I do about the goods` `a bag from a consignment shop for a private owner, not told` EQUALS `I may reject the goods and treat the contract as repudiated`
#ASSERT `What can I do about the goods` `a shop phone with the scratch pointed out` EQUALS `the implied conditions give me no remedy`
#ASSERT `What can I do about the goods` `a shop phone whose fault my inspection should have found` EQUALS `the implied conditions give me no remedy`
#ASSERT `What can I do about the goods` `boots bought for hiking that leak on a trail` EQUALS `I may reject the goods and treat the contract as repudiated`
#ASSERT `What can I do about the goods` `boots bought for hiking on my own judgment` EQUALS `the implied conditions give me no remedy`
#ASSERT `What can I do about the goods` `a used car advertised by a private seller as a 2020 model that is a 2016` EQUALS `I may reject the goods and treat the contract as repudiated`
